{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 11.6.10 — product gallery: the stage no longer crops. Every image
  is shown whole inside a square white stage (letterboxed when it is not
  square), so packshots keep their bases and infographics keep their last
  row. Thumbnails likewise show the full image.

  Temporary carrier; fold into assets/besjaar-product-detail.css during
  consolidation.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style id="besjaar-product-1170">
body[data-page-type="product"] .besjaar-store-premium-pd__stage{position:relative!important;display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;aspect-ratio:1/1!important;height:auto!important;min-height:0!important;max-height:none!important;padding:12px!important;background:#FFFFFF!important;overflow:hidden!important}
body[data-page-type="product"] .besjaar-store-premium-pd__stage img{display:block!important;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;max-height:100%!important;object-fit:contain!important;object-position:center center!important}
/* Besjaar 2026-09-12 — gallery sizing + scroll behaviour.
   1) assets/besjaar-product-step4.css still puts padding:clamp(38px,4.8vw,72px)
      on the stage image. The rule above only overrides width/height/object-fit,
      so that padding survived and ate up to 72px on each side of a 640px stage,
      leaving the photo filling roughly three quarters of its frame. The stage's
      own 12px padding is the inset we want, so zero the image's.
   2) The gallery column was position:sticky with a 118px offset, which pinned
      the photo in place while the page scrolled and left a large gap above it.
      Let it scroll with the rest of the page. To bring the sticky behaviour
      back, change position to sticky and set a top offset here. */
body[data-page-type="product"] .besjaar-store-premium-pd__stage>img{padding:0!important}
body[data-page-type="product"] .besjaar-store-premium-pd__gallery{position:static!important;top:auto!important}
body[data-page-type="product"] .besjaar-store-premium-pd__thumb{background:#FFFFFF!important;overflow:hidden!important}
body[data-page-type="product"] .besjaar-store-premium-pd__thumb img{width:100%!important;height:100%!important;object-fit:contain!important;padding:4px!important;box-sizing:border-box!important;background:#FFFFFF!important}
</style>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Besjaar product gallery",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "11.6.10: the product gallery shows each image whole in a square white stage instead of cropping it. Keep in the header group after the runtime section."
    }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
